# Final Fortune: "Take an extra turn after this one. At the beginning of that turn's end step, you lose the game." (CR 500.7,
# 603.7). Bot1 casts it in turn 1's first main phase. Turn 1's end step comes first and is not "that turn's": Bot1 is still in
# the game at turn 2's upkeep, which is Bot1's extra turn. At the beginning of turn 2's end step the delayed ability triggers,
# and Bot1 loses as it resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Final Fortune
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Final Fortune.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Delayed = Final Fortune
[T2 Bot1.Upkeep]
? ActivePlayer = Bot1
? Result = InProgress
[T2 Bot1.End]
? Stack = Final Fortune
? Result = InProgress

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.LostTo = Effect
Delayed.Count = 0
